id=s688ln_wifi_fix
name=S688LN WiFi+BT Fix (build-matched rfkill, root-agnostic)
version=v0.7-ksun
versionCode=7
author=Viktor
description=Loads the build-matched SIGNED rfkill.ko plus the Unisoc WiFi/BT module chain on a self-built exact-stamp custom kernel. Runs under Magisk OR KernelSU (same post-fs-data/service scripts). No-op on the stock kernel (guard: skips when rfkill is already loaded). Same id as the v0.6 module so it is a drop-in on the ksun (KernelSU) kernel.
